        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor U as User\n    participant A as MOUNTAQA App\n    participant B as Backend\n    participant DB as Mountaqa Database\n    participant API as Food Product API\n    participant R as Rule-Based Engine\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;A: Scan product barcode\n    A-&gt;&gt;B: Send barcode number\n    B-&gt;&gt;DB: Search for cached product\n\n    alt Product found in local database\n        DB--&gt;&gt;B: Return stored product data\n    else Product not cached\n        DB--&gt;&gt;B: Product not found\n        B-&gt;&gt;API: Request product by barcode\n        API--&gt;&gt;B: Return product data\n        B-&gt;&gt;DB: Cache retrieved product data\n    end\n\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Validate and normalize product data\n    B-&gt;&gt;R: Send product data and user profile\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: Apply allergy diet and nutrition rules\n    R--&gt;&gt;B: Return verdict and explanation\n    B-&gt;&gt;DB: Save scan result\n    B--&gt;&gt;A: Return product details and result\n    A--&gt;&gt;U: Display personalized result&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="-6Vii1_xNdS1A3Ko5tno-1">
